@startuml 03-change-lint-rules
title Cambiar reglas de linteo y re-lintear en segundo plano (US #14, #15)
autonumber

actor "Usuario" as user
participant "UI" as ui
participant "nginx" as nginx
participant "Snippet Service" as snippet
database "Snippet DB" as sdb
participant "Azure Blob Storage" as assets
queue "Redis Streams" as redis
participant "PrintScript Service\n(worker A)" as workerA
participant "PrintScript Service\n(worker B)" as workerB

user -> ui : habilita / deshabilita reglas
ui -> nginx : PUT /api/rules/lint (JWT)
nginx -> snippet : PUT /rules/lint
snippet -> snippet : valida JWT y obtiene userId
snippet -> sdb : guarda las reglas del usuario
snippet -> sdb : snippets del usuario (owner):\nlintStatus = PENDING, lintRevision + 1
snippet --> nginx : 202 Accepted
nginx --> ui : 202 Accepted
ui --> user : reglas guardadas (re-linteo en curso)

== Encolado (en segundo plano) ==

loop por cada snippet del usuario
    snippet -> assets : lee "snippets/{id}/original"
    snippet -> redis : XADD lint-requests\n{ snippetId, revision, content, version, rules }
end

== Procesamiento con tolerancia a fallos ==

workerA -> redis : XREADGROUP lint-requests (grupo printscript)
redis --> workerA : mensaje snippet X
workerA -> workerA : lintea snippet X

alt worker A termina bien
    workerA -> redis : XADD lint-results\n{ snippetId, revision, status: VALID | INVALID, violations }
    workerA -> redis : XACK lint-requests
else worker A se cae antes del ACK
    workerA -[#red]> workerA : se cae
    note over redis : el mensaje queda pendiente\n(sin ACK) en el consumer group
    workerB -> redis : XAUTOCLAIM lint-requests\n(mensajes inactivos hace más de N segundos)
    redis --> workerB : mensaje snippet X (entregas = 2)
    alt entregas <= 3
        workerB -> workerB : lintea snippet X
        workerB -> redis : XADD lint-results { snippetId, revision, status, violations }
    else entregas > 3 (el snippet hace fallar al worker)
        workerB -> redis : XADD lint-results { snippetId, revision, status: FAILED }
    end
    workerB -> redis : XACK lint-requests
end

== Resultados ==

redis -> snippet : XREADGROUP lint-results (grupo snippet)
alt revision == lintRevision del snippet
    snippet -> sdb : actualiza lintStatus y reemplaza violaciones
else revision vieja (hubo otro cambio de reglas después)
    snippet -> snippet : descarta el resultado
end
snippet -> redis : XACK lint-results

note over user, redis
  Formateo (US #11, #12): mismo flujo con PUT /rules/format,
  format-requests / format-results y formatStatus. Al recibir el
  resultado, Snippet Service guarda "snippets/{id}/formatted" en Blob Storage.
end note

@enduml
